stereo-create (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release: "Create Stereo" in the context menu of stereo pictures and
    videos, and the stereo-create command: JPS, MPO, PNG side by side, PNS,
    Dubois anaglyphs, the proof pair; Matroska and MP4 stereo video with
    StereoMode, the frame packing SEI and st3d, anaglyph video and frame
    grabs; one job with progress and cancel in the notification area.

